        </a>
        <a href="/blog/sling-angle-factor-explained/" class="cta-box block hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors" style="padding:1rem; margin:0;">
          <p class="text-white font-semibold">Sling Angle Factor Explained</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Why 30° can halve sling capacity</p>
